LOCUS       pLM-AMA18.0_dCas9-VPR  20402 bp    DNA     circular SYN 04-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  Fungal AMA1 backbone plasmid with sp-dCas9 fused to VP64-p65-Rta
            (VPR); ribozymes based sgRNA transcription unit; Terbinafine and
            Phleomycin selection markers.
